# Context for authoring a brand-new Playwright E2E test. Unlike
# playwright_debug_context (analyzing a failing run), this surfaces existing
# page objects/tests as pattern references and points at the two Confluence
# docs the team maintains outside this repo (mocking system + known
# pitfalls) — the providers that support live web fetching (e.g. the claude
# provider's own WebFetch tool) can pull them directly; others still see the
# URLs as a pointer to consult manually.
